<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8311] IgniteClientRejoinTest.testClientsReconnectDisabled causes exchange-worker to terminate via NPE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8311</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Currently, tests use &lt;tt&gt;NoOpFailureHandler&lt;/tt&gt; by default, hence this exchange-worker termination is masked. We are to fix it: test code should not be able to terminate system-critical thread.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13153399">IGNITE-8311</key>
