                            <comment id="16442793" author="andrey-kuznetsov" created="Wed, 18 Apr 2018 16:28:54 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It&apos;s sufficient to set &lt;tt&gt;FailureHandler&lt;/tt&gt; that halts JVM to reproduce the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16492738" author="githubbot" created="Mon, 28 May 2018 14:24:17 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user x-kreator opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4079&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4079&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8311&quot; title=&quot;IgniteClientRejoinTest.testClientsReconnectDisabled causes exchange-worker to terminate via NPE&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8311&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8311&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;: IgniteClientRejoinTest.testClientsReconnectDisabled caus&#8230;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &#8230;es exchange-worker to terminate via NPE.&lt;/p&gt;

